# delegator declares NO grade but delegate declares L4 -> amplification-from-nothing
# -> ill-formed (apply). An ungraded delegator caps the delegate at ungraded.
actor boss
actor sub  grade L4  on-behalf-of boss
gate  decide  grade L1  grant boss sub
cord  sub    -> decide
cord  decide -> master
# (both actors granted equally at decide, so the risk rule passes and only the
# grade rule can reject)
